                <pb facs="0679" n="673" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg673"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. von Holleben.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May 11,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State presents his compliments to the minister of Germany, and
                    asks that he will kindly call at the Department to-day at 3 o’clock for the
                    purpose of discussing a detail in relation to Samoan matters.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
